# Siya Guide knowledge base

`apps/siya-assistant/data/public-kb.json` is regenerated automatically:

1. On `siya-health` `npm run build` (after `seo-build.mjs`)
2. On `siya-assistant` `predev` / `prebuild`

Do **not** ask the user to remember or manually run `npm run build:kb`.

If topic routing is wrong, fix `lib/public-routes.ts` / retrieval / intents and add a case to `scripts/test-topic-routing.ts`.
